type: software
title: "Priority-Constrained Descent (PCD)"
abstract: "PyTorch implementation of Priority-Constrained Descent, a gradient method for hierarchical multi-objective optimization: each update stays as close as possible to the primary objective's gradient while giving every secondary objective a guaranteed, scale-free share of progress."
